*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% eREDES - PPD de paso directo para impresoras termicas ESC/POS.
*% macOS 13+ ya no admite colas "raw". Este PPD crea una cola que envia
*% texto plano y datos RAW (lp -o raw) sin conversion a la impresora.
*% Para imprimir documentos/PDF desde aplicaciones de macOS instale el
*% controlador oficial del fabricante (por ejemplo Epson TM Driver for Mac).
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "EREDESRW.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "eREDES"
*Product: "(eREDES ESC/POS)"
*ModelName: "eREDES ESC/POS Generic RAW"
*ShortNickName: "eREDES ESC/POS RAW"
*NickName: "eREDES ESC/POS Generic RAW (texto y datos directos)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.2
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raw 0 -"
*cupsFilter: "text/plain 0 -"
*OpenUI *PageSize: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: X80mm
*PageSize X80mm/Rollo 80 mm: "<</PageSize[227 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize X58mm/Rollo 58 mm: "<</PageSize[164 842]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize
*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: X80mm
*PageRegion X80mm/Rollo 80 mm: "<</PageSize[227 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion X58mm/Rollo 58 mm: "<</PageSize[164 842]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion
*DefaultImageableArea: X80mm
*ImageableArea X80mm/Rollo 80 mm: "0 0 227 842"
*ImageableArea X58mm/Rollo 58 mm: "0 0 164 842"
*DefaultPaperDimension: X80mm
*PaperDimension X80mm/Rollo 80 mm: "227 842"
*PaperDimension X58mm/Rollo 58 mm: "164 842"
